# A list menu: shown while LB is held, D-pad moves, A picks and closes it.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/menus.padpack Menus
press lb
advance 100
tap dpad-down 30
tap dpad-down 30
tap south 30
advance 100
release lb
---
overlay menu "List" selected "Alpha"   @0
sound menu Open pop                    @0
sound menu Step click                  @100
overlay menu "List" selected "Bravo"   @100
sound menu Step click                  @130
overlay menu "List" selected "Charlie" @130
sound menu Pick pop                    @160
overlay none                           @160
sound menu Close pop                   @160
key KEY_C down                         @160
key KEY_C up                           @160
